#. module: deltatech_pos_stock_shops
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_pos_stock_shops.field_pos_config__stock_shop_warehouse_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_pos_stock_shops.field_res_config_settings__pos_stock_shop_warehouse_ids
msgid ""
"Warehouses shown as other shops. Left empty, the warehouses of the other "
"points of sale of the company are used, so the central warehouse or a "
"transit location only shows up when chosen here."
msgstr ""
"Depozitele afișate ca alte magazine. Dacă rămâne gol, se folosesc depozitele"
" celorlalte puncte de vânzare ale companiei, deci depozitul central sau o "
"locație de tranzit apare doar dacă e aleasă aici."
